{"2129160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blue Wednesday", "steam_appid": 2129160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [2580470, 2477830], "detailed_description": "<h1>CHECK OUT SKEL DUNGEON HERE!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Enter the enchanting world of Blue Wednesday, an interactive game that takes you to the vibrant city of Evans. As jazz pianist Morris, you'll explore the city, interact with other characters, play amazing piano, and much more. Join in and have fun in this picturesque world!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129160/extras/66cdcbd204ac3d3cead5b81c1945aeda.poster.avif?t=1729549375\" width=610 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129160/extras/66cdcbd204ac3d3cead5b81c1945aeda.webm?t=1729549375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129160/extras/66cdcbd204ac3d3cead5b81c1945aeda.mp4?t=1729549375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>See life through Morris's eyes and fall in love with failure, love and jazz.</i><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129160/extras/b9a06cce96fe35ad1540df41b6c5b51e.avif?t=1729549375\" width=610 height=116 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the city of Evans with music </h2>Step into Morris' shoes and explore the city's vibrant streets through mini-games, cutscenes, and conversations with unique characters.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover rare albums and Collect sheet music</h2>Interact with various spots around the city of Evans and encounter other characters to discover rare music albums. From tango to bossa nova, cool jazz to modern jazz, collect a wide range of albums and enrich your rhythm plays.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129160/extras/9c495962ded028e5261a784066774d96.poster.avif?t=1729549375\" width=610 height=343 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129160/extras/9c495962ded028e5261a784066774d96.webm?t=1729549375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the colorful cast</h2>Interact with your neighbors, each with their own story. The choices you make shape the story and lead to collecting valuable items.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich mini-games</h2>Play delightful mini-games that appear at key moments and make your journey more exciting based on your choices.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129160/extras/d780e8e7261696b4ad18999b6a17a406.poster.avif?t=1729549375\" width=610 height=343 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129160/extras/d780e8e7261696b4ad18999b6a17a406.webm?t=1729549375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>If you like this game, please add it to your wishlist! Help us spread this lovely game!</strong>", "about_the_game": "Enter the enchanting world of Blue Wednesday, an interactive game that takes you to the vibrant city of Evans. As jazz pianist Morris, you'll explore the city, interact with other characters, play amazing piano, and much more. Join in and have fun in this picturesque world!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129160/extras/66cdcbd204ac3d3cead5b81c1945aeda.poster.avif?t=1729549375\" width=610 height=340 ><